<p>$$
\begin{aligned}
x &amp;= \cos{\phi}\sin{\theta} \\ 
y &amp;= \sin{\phi}\sin{\theta} \\ 
z &amp;= \cos{\theta} \\ 
\alpha &amp;= \phi + \psi
\end{aligned} \tag{46}
$$</p>

